  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pre-lecture quiz"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-20-pre-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Data Science can be used in many industries such as</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Finance and the Humanities</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Those are two fields, but data science is used in many more, like healthcare and sports.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Agriculture and Manufacturing</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Data science reaches many more fields than these two, like finance and healthcare.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>All of these and more</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Data science is used in finance, healthcare, sports and many more fields.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-20-pre-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Data Science in the context of research can be focus on:</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>innovation opportunities</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Research projects can explore innovation opportunities, like quick prototypes of new ideas.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>error handling</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Research looks at innovation opportunities and at possible harms of data science, not error handling.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>boosting sales</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Research looks at innovation opportunities and at possible harms of data science, not sales.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-20-pre-3\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>The 'Gender Shades Study' focused on</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>transforming gender discourse</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The study measured bias in facial analysis tools by gender and skin type.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>the biases inherent in facial analytics</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. It evaluated bias in automated facial analysis by gender and skin type.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>neither of these</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The study looked at bias in facial analysis tools, based on gender and skin type.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
