    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-20-post-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Digital Humanities is a practice that combines computational methods with humanistic inquiry</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>True</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Digital Humanities uses computer methods, like text analysis, to study history and literature.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>False</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Digital Humanities does combine the two, using computer methods to study history and literature.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-20-post-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Use Data Science for sustainability research by</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>studying deforestation</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Deforestation is one area, but climate change is another.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>studying climate change data</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Climate change is one area, but deforestation is another.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>both of these</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Data science can bring out insights about both climate change and deforestation.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
